        "fontFamily": "-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, sans-serif"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "node_id": "node-skin-lesion-advisor-cb383777",
        "name": "Skin Lesion Advisor",
        "description": "Builds a prompt for medical information about a skin lesion using vector database retrieval.\n\nThis node constructs a prompt for an LLM to provide educational medical information about a specific skin lesion classification. It first parses the classification token (e.g., ‘mel’) from the classification output string. The user’s chosen topic (definition, identification, symptoms, recoveries, treatment, or triage) is mapped to a descriptive query phrase. The node then queries a vector database of dermatological knowledge using the token and the query phrase to retrieve the top‑five most relevant text chunks. These chunks are inserted into a structured prompt alongside the classification token and the chosen topic. The prompt instructs the LLM to answer in clear, patient‑friendly language while adhering to topic‑specific guidance (e.g., listing ABCDE criteria for identification, or describing standard interventions for treatment). A mandatory medical disclaimer is appended to the end of the prompt. The final prompt is ready for downstream LLM inference, enabling the generation of accurate, disclaimed, and context‑relevant health information for end users.",
        "category": "llm",
        "owner_id": "105973339426953711978",
        "visibility": "public",
        "organization_id": 1,
